---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="About | Intuitui Labs" theme="about">
	<div class="max-w-5xl space-y-28 sm:space-y-36">
		<header class="max-w-4xl space-y-8">
			<p class="mono-label">About Intuitui · ;p</p>
			<h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-7xl md:text-8xl font-bold tracking-tighter leading-[0.9]">Serious about systems. Light about ourselves.</h1>
			<p class="max-w-3xl text-2xl text-brand-secondary font-light leading-snug">We are a philosophy-led studio for seeing, understanding, and shaping complex human systems.</p>
		</header>

		<section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] gap-8 md:gap-20 border-t border-black/10 pt-7" aria-labelledby="why-heading">
			<h2 id="why-heading" class="text-sm font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.16em]">Why Intuitui</h2>
			<div class="space-y-6 text-xl text-brand-secondary leading-relaxed">
				<p>Some ideas arrive too early for a category. Some systems are too alive to be understood from a distance. We stay with them long enough to find a truer shape.</p>
				<p>Philosophy is first-class here. Sensemaking is more than traditional research: it is worldview, cultural interpretation, pattern recognition, conversation, reflection, and making.</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="space-y-10" aria-labelledby="method-heading">
			<div class="flex items-end justify-between border-b border-black/10 pb-4"><h2 id="method-heading" class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">The way we move</h2><span class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-secondary/60">not a pipeline</span></div>
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-px bg-black/10 border border-black/10">
				{[
					{ title: 'See', body: 'Attend to what is actually happening.' },
					{ title: 'Make sense', body: 'Find relationships without flattening them.' },
					{ title: 'Give form', body: 'Build the tool, practice, or idea.' },
					{ title: 'Learn', body: 'Let reality answer back.' },
					{ title: 'Continue', body: 'Keep the work alive and revisable.' },
				].map((step, index) => (
					<div class="bg-brand-background p-6 sm:p-7 space-y-8 min-h-44"><span class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-secondary/60">0{index + 1}</span><div class="space-y-2"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold">{step.title}</h3><p class="text-sm text-brand-secondary">{step.body}</p></div></div>
				))}
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:gap-20" aria-labelledby="constellation-heading">
			<div class="space-y-5"><p class="mono-label">The constellation</p><h2 id="constellation-heading" class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight">One philosophy. Many forms.</h2></div>
			<div class="space-y-6 text-brand-secondary leading-relaxed"><p>Intuitui Labs is the common philosophical and systems-making core behind a growing set of work. EdLove is an educational transformation ecosystem. Gurudevi is its first public expression.</p><p>Future work may become a product, an atlas, a community, an inquiry, an operational system, or something we do not have a name for yet.</p><a class="inline-block text-sm font-medium underline decoration-black/20 underline-offset-4" href="/projects">See what is taking shape ↗</a></div>
		</section>

		<section class="bg-brand-primary text-white p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-20 space-y-8" aria-labelledby="tagline-heading">
			<p class="brand-mark border-white/60 text-white">;p</p>
			<h2 id="tagline-heading" class="max-w-2xl text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">Brevity, Clarity, Levity.</h2>
			<p class="font-mono text-sm tracking-[0.16em] text-white/70" aria-label="Brevity, clarity, levity in emoji">⚡ · 💡 · 😜</p>
			<p class="max-w-xl text-white/70 leading-relaxed">We try to say what matters, make complexity legible, and leave enough room for curiosity.</p>
		</section>
	</div>
</MainLayout>
